session total and dropped the per-message output.reasoning breakdown each
turn carries, so to_view's total_usage disagreed with the sum over steps
and with extract_conversation's total (which sums breakdowns since
c65a6b6). It now adds breakdowns class by class.

Retires the known-defect opencode-total-usage-drops-breakdowns:
