From 9eec499c071b132d4bc20aef12e79524659116e8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Robert DeLanghe <1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 15:46:12 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] fix(copilot): session.shutdown's totals settle on the last
 assistant turn
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Copilot's assistant.message reports only outputTokens; the session's
input and cache totals exist once, on session.shutdown. to_view put them in
total_usage and on no turn, so the derived document's steps summed to 173
output tokens while the IR claimed 54 input, 198884 cache-read and 22998
cache-write more: the accounting contract (agent-coding-session v1.1.0,
Σ steps = session totals) did not hold, and every projection and any spend
derived from the document lost ~222k tokens.

Every counter no turn reports is now taken from the shutdown and put,
verbatim, on the last assistant turn's token_usage; total_usage is the sum
over turns. A counter any turn reports stays the per-turn sum (the
shutdown's output, = Σ outputTokens, is never added twice). The last
assistant turn is where the session settles, as Codex puts a round's total
on the round's final turn; its input/cache are the session's, not that
message's own spend, since Copilot records no per-message input. Weighed
and not taken: a session-level usage field (a new kind version, plus
derive, extract, every projector and the goldens invariant), or dropping
the shutdown totals (the regression the shutdown fallback fixed).

Retires copilot-session-totals-not-on-steps, the last accounting defect;
defects.rs drops the accounting_gap measure and Target::Document that
only the three accounting defects used. Copilot snapshots recaptured: the
last assistant step carries input 54 / cache 198884 / 22998, projections
carry them, round trips show which projectors drop cache_write_tokens
(codex, gemini, cursor; cursor also cache_read), shed byte counts move,
and insta rewrote stale input_file headers to the set's real input.
`path goldens capture copilot test-fixtures/copilot/convo.jsonl` recaptured
goldens/copilot/to-{claude,codex,pi}.jsonl, the copilot-{codex,pi} round
trip rows and the copilot set's manifest pins.
Qualifier: 18549e27 (accounting gaps) resolved fixed; 122da212 superseded
(two defects, none accounting); the decision recorded on provider.rs.
Unit test shutdown_totals_settle_on_the_last_assistant_turn.
