Subject: [PATCH] toolpath-model: match a claim's quote whitespace-collapsed;
 pr/27 names pr/01 instead of a squashed-away sha

---
 crates/toolpath-model/src/lib.rs | 2 +-
 pr/27-accounting-totals.md       | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/crates/toolpath-model/src/lib.rs b/crates/toolpath-model/src/lib.rs
index a7fa92bf..f372ec8b 100644
--- a/crates/toolpath-model/src/lib.rs
+++ b/crates/toolpath-model/src/lib.rs
@@ -720,7 +720,7 @@ pub fn generate(inp: &Inputs) -> Result<Value> {
                 )
             })
             .map(|i| i + 1);
-        let found = flat.contains(quote);
+        let found = flat.contains(&quote.split_whitespace().collect::<Vec<_>>().join(" "));
         let ops: Vec<String> = c["operations"]
             .as_array()
             .into_iter()
diff --git a/pr/27-accounting-totals.md b/pr/27-accounting-totals.md
index d7c59583..8de57090 100644
--- a/pr/27-accounting-totals.md
+++ b/pr/27-accounting-totals.md
@@ -11,7 +11,7 @@ defects:
 - `gemini-total-usage-drops-breakdowns`: `toolpath_gemini::provider::sum_usage` added the four counters of every
   turn and dropped their breakdowns, so `total_usage` had no `output.reasoning` (steps 489, IR none, extracted 489).
 - `opencode-total-usage-drops-breakdowns`: `toolpath_opencode::provider::accumulate_total` the same (285 vs none).
-  Both are the bug c65a6b6 (pr/01) fixed in `toolpath_convo::extract`, still present in two adapters.
+  Both are the bug pr/01 fixed in `toolpath_convo::extract`, still present in two adapters.
 - `copilot-session-totals-not-on-steps`: Copilot's `assistant.message` reports only `outputTokens`; the session's
   input and cache totals exist once, on `session.shutdown`. `to_view` put them in `total_usage` and on no turn, so
   the document's steps lacked 54 input, 198884 cache-read and 22998 cache-write tokens the IR claimed. Every
